---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Shipping Policy | Life's Little Things">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 space-y-8 bg-background text-text">
    <header class="space-y-3">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-title font-bold text-primary">Shipping Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-lg">We ship within the United States using USPS or UPS.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-title text-primary">Shipping Methods</h2>
      <p>Orders are shipped by USPS or UPS depending on the order size, destination, and available service options.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-title text-primary">Delivery Estimates</h2>
      <p>Most ready-to-ship items are mailed within one week of order placement. Delivery times depend on the carrier and destination and are only estimates.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-title text-primary">Restrictions</h2>
      <p>We currently ship only within the United States. Custom commissions may follow a separate timeline communicated before purchase.</p>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>